  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-23 (asked while tackling WI-funip, WI-sidus, WI-supar-kikub, WI-jozih, WI-sagur): the pull request for these five items includes their fixes that change what the stable id hashes and makes the one v17 -> v18 scheme bump, with the history row written from measured churn. The question put: \"Some fixes in WI-sidus (layout normalizer gaps) and possibly WI-funip/WI-supar change what the stable id hashes, so they need a scheme bump from v17 to v18 ... What should happen to those commits?\" Answer chosen: \"Bump to v18\". Scope of the ruling: the id-moving fixes of these five items only; other open stable-id items were not asked about."  # 118a
